.SH NAME
QSpinBox \- Spin box widget, sometimes called up-down widget, little arrows widget or spin button
.SH SYNOPSIS
.br
.PP
\fC#include <qspinbox.h>\fR
.PP
Inherits QFrame and QRangeControl.
.PP
